  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a WASH and Shelter Emergency Response for Conflict-affected Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is alleviate the immediate shelter and WASh needs of conflict and displacement affected communities in major sites and hard-to-reach areas, while informing humanitarian programming and decision making. The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 45,430 individuals.</narrative>
